#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:19
#, docstring
msgid ""
"This cog is designed for \"filtering\" unwanted words and phrases from a "
"server.\n"
"\n"
"    It provides tools to manage a list of words or sentences, and to "
"customize automatic actions to be taken against users who use those words "
"in channels or in their name/nickname.\n"
"\n"
"    This can be used to prevent inappropriate language, off-topic "
"discussions, invite links, and more.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"此模块用于"过滤"服务器中的不当词语和短语。\n"
"\n"
"    它提供工具来管理词语或句子列表，并自定义对在频道中使用这些词语或在"
"其名称/昵称中使用这些词语的用户自动采取的操作。\n"
"\n"
"    这可用于防止不当语言、离题讨论、邀请链接等。\n"
"    "

#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:85
#, docstring
msgid "Base command to manage filter settings."
msgstr "管理过滤器设置的基本命令。"

#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:90
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Set the nickname for users with a filtered name.\n"
"\n"
"        Note that this has no effect if filtering names is disabled\n"
"        (to toggle, run `[p]filter names`).\n"
"\n"
"        The default name used is *John Doe*.\n"
"\n"
"        Example:\n"
"        - `[p]filterset defaultname Missingno`\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"\n"
"        - `<name>` The new nickname to assign.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"为名称被过滤的用户设置昵称。\n"
"\n"
"        请注意，如果禁用了名称过滤（使用 `[p]filter names` 切换），此设置将不起作用。\n"
"\n"
"        默认使用的名称为 *John Doe*。\n"
"\n"
"        示例：\n"
"        - `[p]filterset defaultname Missingno`\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"\n"
"        - `<name>` 要分配的新昵称。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:106
msgid "The name to use on filtered names has been set."
msgstr "已设置用于被过滤名称的名称。"

#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:110
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Set the filter's autoban conditions.\n"
"\n"
"        Users will be banned if they send `<count>` filtered words in\n"
"        `<timeframe>` seconds.\n"
"\n"
"        Set both to zero to disable autoban.\n"
"\n"
"        Examples:\n"
"        - `[p]filterset ban 5 5` - Ban users who say 5 filtered words in "
"5 seconds.\n"
"        - `[p]filterset ban 2 20` - Ban users who say 2 filtered words in "
"20 seconds.\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"\n"
"        - `<count>` The amount of filtered words required to trigger a "
"ban.\n"
"        - `<timeframe>` The period of time in which too many filtered "
"words will trigger a ban.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"设置过滤器的自动封禁条件。\n"
"\n"
"        用户如果在 `<timeframe>` 秒内发送了 `<count>` 个过滤词语，将被封禁。\n"
"\n"
"        将两者都设置为零以禁用自动封禁。\n"
"\n"
"        示例：\n"
"        - `[p]filterset ban 5 5` - 封禁在 5 秒内说出 5 个过滤词语的用户。\n"
"        - `[p]filterset ban 2 20` - 封禁在 20 秒内说出 2 个过滤词语的用户。\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"\n"
"        - `<count>` 触发封禁所需的过滤词语数量。\n"
"        - `<timeframe>` 在过多过滤词语触发封禁的时间段。\n"
"        "

#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:128
msgid ""
"Count and timeframe either both need to be 0 or both need to be greater "
"than 0!"
msgstr "数量和时长要么都为 0，要么都大于 0！"

#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:138
msgid "Autoban disabled."
msgstr "自动封禁已禁用。"

#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:143
msgid "Count and time have been set."
msgstr "数量和时长已设置。"

