#: redbot/cogs/filter/filter.py:262
#, docstring
msgid ""
"Add words to the filter.\n"
"\n"
"        Use double quotes to add sentences.\n"
"\n"
"        Examples:\n"
"        - `[p]filter channel add #channel word1 word2 word3`\n"
"        - `[p]filter channel add #channel \"This is a sentence\"`\n"
"\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"\n"
"        - `<channel>` The text, voice, stage, or forum channel to add "
"filtered words to.\n"
"        - `[words...]` The words or sentences to filter.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"将词语添加到过滤器。\n"
"\n"
"        使用双引号来添加句子。\n"
"\n"
"        示例：\n"
"        - `[p]filter channel add #频道 词语1 词语2 词语3`\n"
"        - `[p]filter channel add #频道 \"这是一个句子\"`\n"
"\n"
"        **参数：**\n"
"\n"
"        - `<channel>` 要添加过滤词语的文字、语音、舞台或论坛频道。\n"
"        - `[words...]` 要过滤的词语或句子。\n"
"        "

